        <groundspeak:log id="681458979">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-04-24T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="1298988">dronnord</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP616 CARL5&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;N49° 41.243 W112° 49.702&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After we messed around for about 10 minutes and we couldn`t find anything, I decided to look up some photos on my phone..got to love that option..thanks VDD...it was a clean up the hole and get the shots and WM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This one stumped me as to why it was here then I remembered that CARL is an event and not a dude. &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;13th of the day&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="681184595">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-04-24T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="836983">Coolcat21</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP616 - Carl 5

&lt;strong&gt;Posted:&lt;/strong&gt;  N49° 41.241' W112° 49.702'

&lt;strong&gt;My GPSr:&lt;/strong&gt;  N49° 41.242' W112° 49.703'&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;dronnord and I looked around quite a while for this one, finding nothing and the hint not really making a lot of sense to us. We then looked up some context photos and van der Decken's context shot was golden, helping us zero in on the cap which was covered in some dirt and grass. dronnord shovelled the cap out to make it a much easier find in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
